{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"58721c4c81e84430fff62a1b233e41a608284b0b851fb9a8d469702bd1c5623e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["传扬钉十字架的基督"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄们，从前我到你们那里去，并没有用高言大智对你们宣传 神的奥秘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为我曾定了主意，在你们中间不知道别的，只知道耶稣基督并他钉十字架。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我在你们那里，又软弱，又惧怕又甚战兢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我说的话、讲的道，不是用智慧委婉的言语，乃是用圣灵和大能的明证，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["叫你们的信不在乎人的智慧，只在乎 神的大能。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神借着圣灵启示我们"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而，在完全的人中，我们也讲智慧。但不是这世上的智慧，也不是这世上有权有位、将要败亡之人的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们讲的，乃是从前所隐藏、 神奥秘的智慧，就是 神在万世以前预定使我们得荣耀的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这智慧世上有权有位的人没有一个知道的，他们若知道，就不把荣耀的主钉在十字架上了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如经上所记：",{"text":"神为爱他的人所预备的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛未曾看见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵未曾听见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人心也未曾想到的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["只有 神借着圣灵向我们显明了，因为圣灵参透万事，就是 神深奥的事也参透了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["除了在人里头的灵，谁知道人的事？像这样，除了 神的灵，也没有人知道 神的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们所领受的，并不是世上的灵，乃是从 神来的灵，叫我们能知道 神开恩赐给我们的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["并且我们讲说这些事，不是用人智慧所指教的言语，乃是用圣灵所指教的言语，将属灵的话解释属灵的事",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，属血气的人不领会 神圣灵的事，反倒以为愚拙，并且不能知道，因为这些事惟有属灵的人才能看透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["属灵的人能看透万事，却没有一人能看透了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["谁曾知道主的心去教导他呢？但我们是有基督的心了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译：将属灵的事讲与属灵的人","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}